variable C23 equal 0.5*(-20203.0195731276+20525.6121999568)
variable C3${dir} equal 0.5*(${C3neg}+${C3pos})
variable C33 equal 0.5*(${C3neg}+${C3pos})
variable C33 equal 0.5*(-23684.0453290078+${C3pos})
variable C33 equal 0.5*(-23684.0453290078+24231.2301992966)
variable C4${dir} equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
